  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.1.6: new layered PSD writer (PsdEncoderGpu: layers with position, opacity, 26 blend modes, visibility, Unicode names; merged image with or without alpha; read back exactly by psd-tools); SpawnDev.ILGPU 5.4.49; WGSL size guard covers FLAC. Full list: CHANGELOG.md.",
